@startuml UC44_SSD
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title UC44: System Sequence Diagram - Share Event via Multi-Channel Social Modal

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : clickShareEventButton()
System -> System : detectPlatformCapabilities()
alt mobile device with navigator.share
    System --> User : openNativeShareSheet()
else desktop browser
    System --> User : displayShareModal(WhatsApp, X, Telegram, FB, CopyLink)
end
@enduml
